---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../../../components/common/Container.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="锦乃｜古坟｜WORKS"
  description="使用我的世界 Java Edition于2015年7月10日制作的古坟作品。以百舌鸟的大仙古坟和高崎的八幡塚古坟为创作原型，是锦乃早期的作品之一。"
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative h-[920px] overflow-hidden bg-[#f5f1ea]">
    <picture>
      <img
        src="/images/kofun.jpg"
        alt="古坟"
        class="work-hero absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
        draggable="false"
      />
    </picture>

    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center">
      <Container>
        <div class="hero-content max-w-3xl">

          <p
            class="mt-10 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#f6e8c8]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            KOFUN/ANCIENT BURIAL MOUND
          </p>

          <h1
            class="mt-1 text-[36px] leading-[1.15] text-white"
            style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
          >
            古坟 前方后圆坟
          </h1>

          <p
            class="mt-6 text-xl text-white"
            style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
          >
            古代日本的巨大坟墓。
          </p>

<!-- Gold Divider -->

        <div class="mt-1">

          <img
            src="/images/gold-divider.png"
            alt=""
            class="w-[420px] h-auto select-none pointer-events-none"
            draggable="false"
          />

        </div>

        <!-- Summary -->

        <div class="mt-14 max-w-2xl">
        </div>

      </div>

    </Container>

  </div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 z-30 flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="h-20 w-px bg-white/70"></div>

      <span class="mt-4 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-white">
        SCROLL
      </span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Introduction -->
  <section class="relative bg-[#f8f6f2] overflow-hidden works-detail">
    <img
      src="/images/washi-bg.png"
      alt=""
      class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-full opacity-[0.3] pointer-events-none select-none -z-0"
    />

    <Container class="py-32 relative z-10">

      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">

        <div class="flex items-center gap-6">

          <span class="h-px w-24 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#9a8358]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            OVERVIEW
          </p>

        </div>

        <h2
          class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          作品概况
        </h2>

        <p
          class="mt-10 max-w-4xl text-base leading-10 text-[#55504a]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          在1000多年前的古代日本，曾有修建形似钥匙孔的大型坟墓的习俗。这件作品是一座于2015年7月10日制作的古坟。<br>
          作品以百舌鸟的大仙古坟和高崎的八幡塚古坟为创作原型，并以想象中刚建成时整洁而完整的姿态为目标进行制作。
        </p>

      </div>

      <div class="mx-auto mt-24 grid max-w-6xl gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px]">

        <div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

            <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

            <p
              class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#9a8358]"
              style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
            >
              HISTORY
            </p>

          </div>

          <h2
            class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
            style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
          >
            关于古坟
          </h2>

          <p
            class="mt-10 text-base leading-10 text-[#4f4944]"
            style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
          >
            这是我在创作早期制作的一座前方后圆坟。 <br><br>

制作于2015年7月10日。当时学校的社会课开始学习古坟时代，我也因此产生了制作古坟的想法。
如今留存下来的古坟经过漫长岁月，植被已经在其上生长并形成稳定的生态环境，因此外观与当时相比已经有了很大的不同。
而这里并没有表现如今所看到的样貌，而是将建成之后最初的姿态作为一种形象进行呈现。 <br><br>

在形制和构成方面，我参考了百舌鸟的大仙古坟与高崎的八幡塚古坟。<br><br>

并没有直接复原其中任何一座古坟，而是分别从两座古坟中汲取特点，将它们融入自己的想象，建造出一座属于我心目中的前方后圆坟。 <br><br>

在更换当时使用的电脑之前，我曾将世界存档进行了迁移，因此这件作品与初代试作江户城一同得以保留下来。<br><br>
这是如今仍然可以确认其制作当时状态的早期作品之一。
</p>

        </div>

        <aside class="relative">

          <div
            class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#e2d8cb] bg-[#fffdfa] p-10 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,.07)]"
          >

            <p
              class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#a68b64]"
              style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
            >
              DATA
            </p>

            <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">

              <div>
                <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">作品名称</p>
                <p class="text-base">古坟</p>
              </div>

              <div>
                <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">分类</p>
                <p class="text-base">古坟・前方后圆坟</p>
              </div>

              <div>
                <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">建造日期</p>
                <p class="text-base">2015年7月10日</p>
              </div>

              <div>
                <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">所在地</p>
                <p class="text-base">
                  建筑保存用世界
                </p>
              </div>

              <div>
                <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">建造者</p>
                <p class="text-base">锦乃</p>
              </div>

              <div>
                <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">形式</p>
                <p class="text-base">前方后圆坟</p>
              </div>

              <div>
                <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作环境</p>
                <p class="text-base">
                  我的世界：Java Edition<br>
                  Forge 1.10.2
                </p>
              </div>

              <div>
                <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">作品类别</p>
                <p class="text-base">历史建筑</p>
              </div>

              <div>
                <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作状态</p>
                <p class="text-base">已完成（保存于建筑保存用世界）</p>
              </div>

            </div>

          </div>

        </aside>

      </div>

      <!-- Gallery -->
      <div class="mx-auto mt-32 max-w-6xl">

        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            GALLERY
          </p>

        </div>

        <h2
          class="mt-6 text-4xl"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          展示照片
        </h2>

        <div class="gallery mt-12">

          <div class="gallery-frame">
            <img
              src="/images/kofun.jpg"
              alt="古坟 全景"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="gallery-frame">
            <img
              src="/images/kofun1.jpg"
              alt="古坟 全景"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="gallery-frame">
            <img
              src="/images/kofun2.jpg"
              alt="古坟 全景"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="gallery-frame">
            <img
              src="/images/kofun3.jpg"
              alt="古坟 全景"
            />
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Navigation -->
      <div class="mt-24 flex flex-wrap gap-4">

        <a
          href="/zh-cn/works/"
          class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
        >
          ← 在WORKS中查看其他作品
        </a>

      </div>

              <!-- Share -->
      <div class="mt-32 text-center">

        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            SHARE
          </p>

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        </div>

        <h2
          class="mt-6 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          分享作品
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">

          <a
            href="#"
            id="x-share"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            X
          </a>

          <button
            type="button"
            id="instagram-share"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            Instagram
          </button>

          <button
            type="button"
            id="copy-url"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            复制URL
          </button>

        </div>

      </div>

    </Container>
  </section>

  <script>
    const sharePhrases = [
      "找到这个了。",
      "这个莫名有点喜欢。",
      "看看这个。",
      "发现了个挺让人在意的东西。",
      "发现了这个。",
      "你知道这个吗？",
      "发现了个东西。",
      "原来还有这个。",
      "发现了个有点在意的东西。"
    ];

    const randomPhrase =
      sharePhrases[Math.floor(Math.random() * sharePhrases.length)];

    const pageUrl = "https://www.nishikinolab.net/zh-cn/kofun/";
    const shareText = `${randomPhrase} Minecraft 古坟 | WORKS`;

    const xShare = document.getElementById("x-share");
    const copyButton = document.getElementById("copy-url");
    const instagramButton = document.getElementById("instagram-share");

    xShare?.setAttribute(
      "href",
      `https://x.com/intent/post?text=${encodeURIComponent(shareText)}&url=${encodeURIComponent(pageUrl)}`
    );

    copyButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);

        if (copyButton) {
          copyButton.textContent = "已复制";

          setTimeout(() => {
            copyButton.textContent = "复制URL";
          }, 2000);
        }
      } catch (error) {
        console.error(error);
      }
    });

    instagramButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
      const dialog = document.createElement("div");

      dialog.innerHTML = `
        <div
          id="instagram-share-overlay"
          style="
            position:fixed;
            inset:0;
            z-index:9999;
            display:flex;
            align-items:center;
            justify-content:center;
            padding:24px;
            background:rgba(43,39,36,.55);
            backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
          "
        >
          <div
            style="
              width:100%;
              max-width:420px;
              padding:36px;
              border:1px solid #e2d8cb;
              border-radius:28px;
              background:#fffdfa;
              box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
              text-align:center;
            "
          >

            <p
              style="
                margin:0;
                font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
                font-size:14px;
                letter-spacing:.35em;
                color:#a58c65;
              "
            >
              SHARE
            </p>

            <h3
              style="
                margin:14px 0 0;
                font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
                font-size:24px;
                color:#2b2724;
                font-weight:400;
              "
            >
              在Instagram上分享
            </h3>

            <p
              style="
                margin:20px 0 0;
                font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
                font-size:14px;
                line-height:2;
                color:#625a52;
              "
            >
              复制本作品页面的URL后<br>
              将打开Instagram。
            </p>

            <button
              id="instagram-open"
              type="button"
              style="
                width:100%;
                margin-top:28px;
                padding:14px 20px;
                border:1px solid #d7c8b3;
                border-radius:999px;
                background:#2b2724;
                color:#fff;
                font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
                font-size:15px;
                cursor:pointer;
              "
            >
              复制URL并打开Instagram
            </button>

            <button
              id="instagram-cancel"
              type="button"
              style="
                width:100%;
                margin-top:10px;
                padding:12px 20px;
                border:0;
                background:transparent;
                color:#8c8378;
                font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
                font-size:14px;
                cursor:pointer;
              "
            >
              取消
            </button>

          </div>
        </div>
      `;

      document.body.appendChild(dialog);

      const overlay = document.getElementById("instagram-share-overlay");
      const openButton = document.getElementById("instagram-open");
      const cancelButton = document.getElementById("instagram-cancel");

      openButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {

        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);
        } catch (error) {
          console.error(error);
        }

        window.open(
          "https://www.instagram.com/",
          "_blank",
          "noopener,noreferrer"
        );

        overlay?.remove();
      });

      cancelButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
        overlay?.remove();
      });

      overlay?.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
        if (event.target === overlay) {
          overlay.remove();
        }
      });
    });
  </script>

  <style>
    .work-hero {
      animation: heroFloat 12s ease-in-out infinite;
      transform-origin: center;
    }

    @keyframes heroFloat {
      0% {
        transform: scale(1.03) translateY(0);
      }

      50% {
        transform: scale(1.06) translateY(-18px);
      }

      100% {
        transform: scale(1.03) translateY(0);
      }
    }

    section {
      position: relative;
    }

    section::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      pointer-events: none;
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 8% 10%,
          rgba(205,175,98,.08),
          transparent 18%
        ),
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 92% 82%,
          rgba(205,175,98,.06),
          transparent 22%
        );
    }

    aside {
      position: sticky;
      top: 120px;
      height: max-content;
    }

    a {
      transition: .35s;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1100px) {
      section {
        overflow: hidden;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      aside {
        position: relative;
        top: auto;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      section:first-child {
        height: 760px;
      }

      .work-hero {
        animation: none;
      }
    }

    .gallery-frame {
      position: relative;
      padding: 2px;
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
      background:
        linear-gradient(
          to right,
          transparent 0%,
          rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.65) 25%,
          rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.65) 50%,
          rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.65) 75%,
          transparent 100%
        );
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .gallery-frame img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      border-radius: calc(1.25rem - 2px);
      background: #f8f6f2;
    }

    .gallery-frame:hover {
      background:
        linear-gradient(
          to right,
          transparent 0%,
          rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.9) 25%,
          rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.9) 50%,
          rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.9) 75%,
          transparent 100%
        );
    }
  </style>
</Layout>